  "description": "After proposing to his girlfriend, Do-Jin wakes up the next morning in a strange house with no memory of how he got there. When he asks about his fiancée, her brother Ju-Yeon gives him a chilling answer: “She’s dead.” But Do-Jin can tell immediately that Ju-Yeon is hiding something. Stranger still, Do-Jin has been having vivid, recurring dreams in which he and Ju-Yeon share a bond that goes far beyond a typical in-law relationship. As he digs deeper, the secrets Ju-Yeon reveal will turn Do-Jin’s entire understanding of his love and his life on its head.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes 4 extra chapters.*",
